        <div class="pricing-v2-faq-list">
            <div class="pricing-v2-faq-item">
                <button class="pricing-v2-faq-q" onclick="togglePricingFaq(this)">
                    <span>What are clusters and apps?</span>
                    <span class="pricing-v2-faq-arrow">+</span>
                </button>
                <div class="pricing-v2-faq-a">
                    <p>A cluster is the managed environment your app runs on. An app is one running application inside that environment.</p>
                    <p>Starter capacity gets you online quickly; Scale Up lets you add more clusters and apps when your product needs more room.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pricing-v2-faq-item">
                <button class="pricing-v2-faq-q" onclick="togglePricingFaq(this)">
                    <span>When will I be billed?</span>
                    <span class="pricing-v2-faq-arrow">+</span>
                </button>
                <div class="pricing-v2-faq-a">
                    <p>You can build locally for free. Billing starts when you activate a paid plan for an app. Your billing schedule starts on the day your first payment is made. Starter is billed every 7 days; Startup and Scale Up are billed monthly unless agreed otherwise.</p>
                    <p>Extra or larger clusters and apps, and storage above the included amount, are measured during the month and billed at the end of the month.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pricing-v2-faq-item">
                <button class="pricing-v2-faq-q" onclick="togglePricingFaq(this)">
                    <span>What capacity is included, and can I cap my bill?</span>
                    <span class="pricing-v2-faq-arrow">+</span>
                </button>
                <div class="pricing-v2-faq-a">
                    <p>Every paid plan includes fixed cluster, app, and storage capacity as shown on the plan card. That included capacity is part of the plan price.</p>
                    <p>From Scale Up, you decide which extra clusters, apps, storage, or options are added before they affect your bill. Fluxzero is designed to make usage visible before it becomes a surprise.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pricing-v2-faq-item">
                <button class="pricing-v2-faq-q" onclick="togglePricingFaq(this)">
                    <span>Is sales tax included?</span>
                    <span class="pricing-v2-faq-arrow">+</span>
                </button>
