                </button>
                <div class="pricing-v2-faq-a">
                    <p>Scale Up supports additional clusters and apps and includes a 99.9% uptime target.</p>
                    <p>Enterprise adds custom workloads, additional sizes, private hardware, custom SLAs, and dedicated operational support. Fluxzero currently runs from Europe, with more regions planned.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pricing-v2-faq-item">
                <button class="pricing-v2-faq-q" onclick="togglePricingFaq(this)">
                    <span>What happens if I go over included limits?</span>
                    <span class="pricing-v2-faq-arrow">+</span>
                </button>
                <div class="pricing-v2-faq-a">
                    <p>Extra or larger clusters and apps can be added from Scale Up. These are measured during the month and billed at the end of the month.</p>
                    <p>If your data volume exceeds included storage, additional storage is billed at €0.0048 per GB per day.</p>
                    <p>Our fair use limits are designed to cover typical application traffic for most products. If your application generates unusually high public network traffic, we may temporarily limit traffic, request changes, or move you to a suitable plan.</p>
                </div>
